    "traits": {
      "value": [
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Stench"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(aura, olfactory)\n\n30 feet. A creature entering the aura or starting its turn in the area must succeed at a 19 Fortitude save or become sickened 1 (plus slowed 1 for as long as it's sickened on a critical failure)\n\nWhile within the aura, affected creatures take a \u20132 circumstance penalty to saves against disease and to recover from the sickened condition. A creature that succeeds at its save is temporarily immune to all globsters' stenches for 1 minute."
            },
            "id": "21ef8bb1-347c-49d4-ba09-efac210fde65",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-19T22:58:52.486333"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Nauseating Slap"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(poison)\n\nA living creature struck by a globster's tendril must attempt a 19 Fortitude save. On a failure, the creature becomes sickened 1. If the creature is already sickened, the condition value increases by 1, to a maximum of sickened 4. Once a creature succeeds at its saving throw, it is temporarily immune for 24 hours."
            },
            "id": "2818a83c-e260-4f35-9c21-c22fca29977c",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-19T22:58:52.486333"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Saturated"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "A globster can survive for 1 hour out of the water, after which it risks drowning and suffocation."
            },
            "id": "b277b840-71ab-4f8c-a122-445287921b04",
            "updated_at": {
